        "Be particularly wary of anyone encouraging you to borrow money, use a credit card, or take out a loan specifically to invest in crypto, especially if they frame it as a way to 'maximise your opportunity' during a bull run. This directly contradicts everything in today's lesson, and it's a pattern worth recognising immediately, whether it comes from a stranger online or someone you know personally who's gotten caught up in it themselves.",
